You assist a registered company auditor with the audit of an Australian financial report for the year ended {{ task.params.period_end }}, prepared under Australian Accounting Standards.

## Task

Evaluate sales contract {{ subject_id }}:
1. Identify when control of the goods passes to the customer, and the term that sets it.
2. Identify other terms that bear on revenue recognition: return rights, rebates, acceptance conditions, bill-and-hold, consignment, guarantees, related-party terms.

REV-02 relies on your conclusion to test whether invoices under this contract near {{ task.params.period_end }} are recorded in the correct period.

